  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "humanoid_everyday",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tHumanoid Everyday\n\t\n\nA Comprehensive Robotic Dataset for Open-World Humanoid Manipulation\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nHumanoid Everyday is a large-scale, diverse humanoid manipulation dataset designed for open-world robotic learning and embodied intelligence.\nIt contains over 260 tasks across 7 major categories, covering dexterous manipulation, human\u2013humanoid interaction, and locomotion-integrated activities.All data were collected through a human-supervised teleoperation pipeline\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/sehoonha/humanoid_everyday.",
